==Problem description==
The Wi-Fi antenna has broken off the board.

* Pi '''3''' (B only)

[[File:Pi3B Wifi Antenna.jpg|alt=Pi 3B Wi-Fi antenna|thumb|Pi 3B Wi-Fi antenna ]]

==Symptoms==

*Wi-Fi antenna has broken off the board.

==Solution==
Replace with one of the following parts:

* <code>SLDA52-2R450G-S1</code>